68. Product can have five colors
Answer: Array
Reason: An array stores multiple colors in one field.
69. Customer has one residential address
Answer: Embedded Document
Reason: Address details such as city, state and pincode can be grouped together.
70. Order contains multiple products
Answer: Array of Embedded Documents
Reason: Each item can store its product name, quantity and price.
71. Product has RAM, storage and processor information
Answer: Embedded Document
Reason: Related specifications can be stored together.
72. Customer can have thousands of orders over many years
Answer: Separate Collection / Reference
Reason: A separate orders collection avoids an excessively large customer document.
73. Product can have millions of customer reviews
Answer: Separate Collection / Reference
Reason: A separate reviews collection supports large numbers of reviews without making the product document excessively large.
74. Employee has first name and last name
Answer: Simple Fields
Reason: First name and last name are individual values.
75. Product has multiple tags
Answer: Array
Reason: An array can store multiple tags in one field.
Array for categories: A supplier can provide multiple product categories.
Embedded document for contact details: Phone number and email are related information that can be grouped together.
Array for warehouse locations: A supplier can operate multiple warehouses, so an array stores the locations in one field.